<title>DENMARK: Danish Great Belt issues 200 mln Dkk 4.0 pct bond.</title>
<headline>Danish Great Belt issues 200 mln Dkk 4.0 pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond issue was announced on Tuesday by arranger Den Danske Bank.</p>
<p>BORROWER: A/S STOREBAELTSFORBINDELSEN (GREAT BELT LINK).</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 200 MILLION DANISH CROWNS. COUPON:FOUR PERCENT.</p>
<p>MATURITY: 15 AUGUST 2005.  ISS DATE: 8 APRIL 1997</p>
<p>ISS PRICE: TO BE ADVISED. GUARANTOR: KINGDOM OF DENMARK.</p>
<p>--Copenhagen newsroom +45-339</p>
</text>
